rment\n - [NOT] unwilling to use a novel pillbox\n - [NOT] unable to meet with the research team<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
 - 18 years of age or older
 - speak English
 - be prescribed to take two or more medications per day, [AND] and manage their own medications.
Exclusion Criteria:
 - have a significant cognitive impairment
 - [NOT] unwilling to use a novel pillbox
 - [NOT] unable to meet with the research team
