hout cancer diagnosis\n  -  Non-English speaking\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\n - Male [OR] or female patients [AND] with invasive bladder cancer scheduled for radical cystectomy at UNC within the next 30 days\n - English-speaking\n - Ability to access the Internet (either themselves or with assistance from their caregiver)\n - Ability to read\n - Ability to provide informed consent.\nExclusion Criteria:\n - [NOT] Inability to read\n - [NOT] Inability to provide informed consent\n - Severe psychiatric illness\n - Cystectomy surgery [NOT] without cancer diagnosis\n - [NOT] Non-English speaking<|eot_id|>']
