 - English-speaking
 - Ability to access the Internet (either themselves or with assistance from their caregiver)
 - Ability to read
 - Ability to provide informed consent.
Exclusion Criteria:
 - [NOT] Inability to read
 - [NOT] Inability to provide informed consent
 - Severe psychiatric illness
 - Cystectomy surgery [NOT] without cancer diagnosis
 - [NOT] Non-English speaking
