gnance, chronic malnutrition, anaemia\n  -  History or on therapy with medication known to interfere with bone metabolism such as steroids, hormones, diuretics, cortisone or anti-seizure medication\n  -  Taking regularly any nutritional supplements and unwilling to stop for the study\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria\n - Screened to be generally healthy as determined by standard medical assessment on physical [AND] and mental health\n - Tanner stage 2 based on breast development for girls, [AND] and pubic hair in boys. Girls will have to be premenarcheal\n - Having obtained his/her informed consent and parents or legal guardians consent\nExclusion Criteria:\n - History of serious medical conditions such as intestinal [OR] or severe metabolic diseases, disorders such as diabetes, [OR] renal, [OR] hepatic [OR] or pancreatic diseases, disorders, [OR] ulcer, [OR] hyperthyroidism, [OR] malignance, chronic malnutrition, [OR] anaemia\n - History [OR] or on therapy with medication known to interfere with bone metabolism such as steroids, [OR] hormones, [OR] diuretics, [OR] cortisone [OR] or anti-seizure medication\n - Taking regularly any nutritional supplements [AND] and [NOT] unwilling to [NOT] stop for the study<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria
 - Screened to be generally healthy as determined by standard medical assessment on physical [AND] and mental health
 - Tanner stage 2 based on breast development for girls, [AND] and pubic hair in boys. Girls will have to be premenarcheal
 - Having obtained his/her informed consent and parents or legal guardians consent
Exclusion Criteria:
 - History of serious medical conditions such as intestinal [OR] or severe metabolic diseases, disorders such as diabetes, [OR] renal, [OR] hepatic [OR] or pancreatic diseases, disorders, [OR] ulcer, [OR] hyperthyroidism, [OR] malignance, chronic malnutrition, [OR] anaemia
 - History [OR] or on therapy with medication known to interfere with bone metabolism such as steroids, [OR] hormones, [OR] diuretics, [OR] cortisone [OR] or anti-seizure medication
 - Taking regularly any nutritional supplements [AND] and [NOT] unwilling to [NOT] stop for the study
