and less than 5th grade education level.\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\n - Women aged  18 or older undergoing medical [OR] or surgical abortion at Planned Parenthood of Illinois (PPIL) will be eligible for inclusion. Inclusion criteria include having an intrauterine pregnancy, having a smart phone to be able to follow-up by text message 2-4 weeks after the clinic appointment, having [NOT] no contraindications to an outpatient medication [OR] or surgical abortion that same day, and [NOT] not meeting any exclusion criteria.\nExclusion Criteria:\n - Exclusion criteria will include [NOT] non-English speaking, [NOT] no working telephone, and less than 5th grade education level.<|eot_id|>']
