e neuropatic pain rated at least 5 on the 10-point numerical rating scale (NRS)\nExclusion Criteria:\n - cardiac arrest history\n - history of neurologi disease [OR] or brain surgery\n - unstable heart disease [OR] or presence of a cardiac pacemaker\n - pain resulting from other causes like as neuromuscular diseases\n - psychiatric disorder\n - diabetes mellitus\n - abnormal renal function\n - contraindication for MRI, [OR] or pregnancy.<|eot_id|>']
