- With [NOT] non-specific back pain that does [NOT] not incapacitate them for the realization of their sport [OR] or work activity.\nExclusion Criteria:\n - Federated boxers with lumbar injury [AND] with medical diagnosis\n - Who are [OR] or have been treated by pharmacological [OR] or physiotherapy in the last 6 months\n - Presenting allergies [OR] or alterations of the skin\n - Not sign the informed consent document.<|eot_id|>']
