 an intensified recovery program (ERAS) with any level of compliance with the protocol (from 0-100%).\nExclusion Criteria:\n - Patients undergoing emergency surgery\n - Endoscopic procedures\n - [NOT] Non-oncological gastric surgery\n - Patients who refuse to participate<|eot_id|>']
