-  Somatic disorders including central nervous system (CNS) involvement\n  -  Known or suspected non-compliance, drug or alcohol abuse\n  -  Metal implants\n  -  Weight < 42 kg\n  -  Suicide risk or very likely to require psychiatric hospitalisation\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\n - Major Depressive Disorder according to Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders (DSM-V)\n - > 25 years\n - Sufficient understanding of the German language\nExclusion Criteria:\n - < 25 years\n - Concomitant diagnosis of past [OR] or present psychotic disorder\n - Concomitant diagnosis of past [OR] or present bipolar disorder\n - First degree relative with a psychotic disorder\n - [NOT] Unable [OR] or [NOT] unwilling to [NOT] discontinue antidepressant medication\n - Pregnancy [OR] or breastfeeding\n - Known hypersensitivity to LSD\n - Somatic disorders including central nervous system (CNS) involvement\n - Known [OR] or suspected non-compliance, drug [OR] or alcohol abuse\n - Metal implants\n - Weight < 42 kg\n - Suicide risk [OR] or very likely to require psychiatric hospitalisation<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
 - Major Depressive Disorder according to Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders (DSM-V)
 - > 25 years
 - Sufficient understanding of the German language
Exclusion Criteria:
 - < 25 years
 - Concomitant diagnosis of past [OR] or present psychotic disorder
 - Concomitant diagnosis of past [OR] or present bipolar disorder
 - First degree relative with a psychotic disorder
 - [NOT] Unable [OR] or [NOT] unwilling to [NOT] discontinue antidepressant medication
 - Pregnancy [OR] or breastfeeding
 - Known hypersensitivity to LSD
 - Somatic disorders including central nervous system (CNS) involvement
 - Known [OR] or suspected non-compliance, drug [OR] or alcohol abuse
 - Metal implants
 - Weight < 42 kg
 - Suicide risk [OR] or very likely to require psychiatric hospitalisation
