ined from the patient or the parents before any study related procedures.\n - Patients of both genders older than 6 months [AND] and younger than 80 years\n - The patient has a diagnosis of Wilson dis-ease\nExclusion Criteria:\n - [NOT] No Informed consent from the patient or the parents before any study related procedures\n - Patients of both genders younger than 6 months [AND] and older than 80 years\n - [NOT] No diagnosis of Wilson disease<|eot_id|>']
