rgy to bupivacaine\n - pre-operative opioid usage within the last six months\n - patients allergic to Percocet [OR] or acetaminophen\n - patients taking tricyclic antidepressants (interaction with bupivacaine)\n - vulnerable populations (prisoners [OR] or pregnant women)<|eot_id|>']
