urgery, cardiac surgery and pelvic radiotherapy\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\n - presence of erectile dysfunction\nExclusion Criteria:\n - Presence of uncontrolled diabetes mellitus,\n - Presence of uncontrolled hypertension,\n - Presence of uncontrolled lipid metabolism disorders,\n - Presence of neurological diseases,\n - Presence of heamatological diseases,\n - Urinary tract infection,\n - Diagnosis of any malignencies,\n - Chronic kidney failure,\n - Presence of metabolic syndrome,\n - Presence of psychiatric diseases [OR] and/or medical treatment,\n - Smoking,\n - History of pelvic surgery, [OR] cardiac surgery [OR] and pelvic radiotherapy<|eot_id|>']
