e medications\n - recurrent anal fissure after previous sphincterotomy\n - prior history of anal surgery\n - other benign anorectal diseases\n - with inflammatory bowel diseases<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
 - Chronic anal fissure lasting more than 6 weeks
Exclusion Criteria:
 - Pregnant
 - cardiovascular disease [OR] or heart failure
 - on antihypertensive medications
 - recurrent anal fissure after previous sphincterotomy
 - prior history of anal surgery
 - other benign anorectal diseases
 - with inflammatory bowel diseases
