ype 1 [OR] or 2)\n - Patients addressed to a one-day hospitalization to assess cardiovascular comorbidities, between January 2014 and May 2017, in the diabetes department, in the Pitié-Salpêtrière hospital\n - Coronary artery calcium score available\n - Toe-brachial index available\nExclusion Criteria:\n - History of coronary artery disease\n - History of Raynaud\'s syndrome\n - Opposition of the patient<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
 - Age ≥ 18 ans
 - Diabetes mellitus (type 1 [OR] or 2)
 - Patients addressed to a one-day hospitalization to assess cardiovascular comorbidities, between January 2014 and May 2017, in the diabetes department, in the Pitié-Salpêtrière hospital
 - Coronary artery calcium score available
 - Toe-brachial index available
Exclusion Criteria:
 - History of coronary artery disease
 - History of Raynaud's syndrome
 - Opposition of the patient
