eal thickness\n - Ocular condition that may predispose the eye to complications\n - History of chemical injury [OR] or delayed epithelial healing\n - Condition that would interfere with or prolong epithelial healing\n - Known sensitivity to treatment medications\n - Pregnancy<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
 - Documented keratoconus [OR] or ectasia after refractive surgery
Exclusion Criteria:
 - Insufficient corneal thickness
 - Ocular condition that may predispose the eye to complications
 - History of chemical injury [OR] or delayed epithelial healing
 - Condition that would interfere with or prolong epithelial healing
 - Known sensitivity to treatment medications
 - Pregnancy
