ity] < 70% et FEV1 < 50%)\n - Informed consent\n - Affiliation to a social security scheme\nExclusion Criteria:\n - Effort oxygen therapy\n - Cardiovascular, [OR] neuromuscular [OR] or musculoskeletal disorders that can provide significant dyspnea [OR] or limit exercise\n - Legal incapacity\n - Low or no cooperation anticipated<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
 - Severe COPD (FEV1 [forced expiratory volume in 1 second] / FVC [forced vital capacity] < 70% et FEV1 < 50%)
 - Informed consent
 - Affiliation to a social security scheme
Exclusion Criteria:
 - Effort oxygen therapy
 - Cardiovascular, [OR] neuromuscular [OR] or musculoskeletal disorders that can provide significant dyspnea [OR] or limit exercise
 - Legal incapacity
 - Low or no cooperation anticipated
