otrusion of less than 5mm\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\n - Prescription of a Narval CC mandibular advancement device\n - Age ≥ 18 years\n - Ability to understand the study information and information on usage of personal data\n - Signed and dated informed consent\nExclusion Criteria:\n - Patients with central sleep apnea (central AI > 5/hour)\n - Patients with loose teeth [OR] and severe parodontitis\n - Patients with completely missing teeth [OR] or removable tooth replacement, [OR] or with a teeth health [NOT] insufficient to retain an MAD Patients with missing molars Patients with maximum protrusion of less than 5mm<|eot_id|>']
