1 to 2 days in the company\n - [NOT] Not have previous experience in a frigorifico, [OR] or butcher\'s shop\n - [NOT] Not have prior knowledge of the activity. To experienced workers\n - Work on the task for more than six months\n - Be present in company during the study period\nExclusion Criteria:\nFor all workers\n - Had already received ergonomic training (general guidelines and postural adjustments)\n - Pregnant women\n - People with disabilities.<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
To Novato workers
 - 1 to 2 days in the company
 - [NOT] Not have previous experience in a frigorifico, [OR] or butcher's shop
 - [NOT] Not have prior knowledge of the activity. To experienced workers
 - Work on the task for more than six months
 - Be present in company during the study period
Exclusion Criteria:
For all workers
 - Had already received ergonomic training (general guidelines and postural adjustments)
 - Pregnant women
 - People with disabilities.
