aving the ability to learn the standard toothbrushing method with artificial intelligence powered toothbrush.\n - Ability and willingness to give written informed consent.\nExclusion Criteria:\n - Edentulous mouth.\n - Pregnant females.\n - Having received professional periodontal treatment (other than supragingival cleaning) within the previous 12 months.\n - Having received antibiotic medication within the previous 3 months.<|eot_id|>']
