us insuffiency: clearly visual venous insufficiency (CEAP 1 and 2)\n - BMI between 24 and 30\nExclusion Criteria:\n - Volunteers using medication (exception for contraception)\n - Volunteers having comorbidities\n - Pregnant women\n - Women [AND] who menstruate on the test date\n - Volunteers with an implanted elektronical device (IPG, [OR] Pacemaker)<|eot_id|>']
