 months\n - Completion of 3 open water dives\n - Proficient in written and verbal English\nExclusion Criteria:\n - Younger than 18 years of age [OR] or older than 95 years of age\n - [NOT] Not a member of WAVES Project within 3 months of study recruitment\n - Has [NOT] not completed 3 open water dives\n - [NOT] Not proficient in written and verbal English<|eot_id|>']
