 - patient with acute respiratory failure, [NOT] not intubated, [AND] who require non invasive mechanical ventilation
Exclusion Criteria:
 - patients in which it is [NOT] not possible to place the esophageal catheter [OR] or it is [NOT] not possible to detect the diaphragm by ultrasound [OR] or it is [NOT] not possible to apply the nasal cannula device
