D] with brace treatment.\n - Ability to read and understand English [OR] or French.\n - Physical [AND] and mental ability to adhere to bracing protocol.\nExclusion Criteria:\n - Diagnosis of other musculoskeletal [OR] or developmental illness that might be responsible for the spinal curvature.\n - Patients with symptom of a neurological disorder.\n - Patients with any other disorder of the musculoskeletal system affecting the lower limbs,<|eot_id|>']
